1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 5)

2
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:38,880
Stop right there!

3
00:00:43,359 --> 00:00:44,359
Get him!

4
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:52,840
After him!

5
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,240
Don't run!

6
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:07,439
Stop!

7
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,120
Get him!

8
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,599
Mr. Zhao?

9
00:01:25,959 --> 00:01:26,959
Come with me.

10
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:31,959
Watch your back!

11
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,760
Zhao Shengge?

12
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:56,040
Mr. Zhao, what are you doing here?

13
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,200
What do you think?

14
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:01,199
Do you really think this is a coincidence?

15
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:21,680
Just to win a bid,

16
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:23,239
you're willing to risk everything?

17
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,199
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

18
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:30,280
I haven't even thanked you
for the ride to Yingchi yet.

19
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,840
That's hardly the same.

20
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,918
It was so dangerous this time.

21
00:02:33,919 --> 00:02:35,359
So you do know how dangerous it was.

22
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,640
Here I thought you had no idea.

23
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,240
Mr. Zhao,

24
00:02:39,241 --> 00:02:40,759
all the routes have been cleared.

25
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,718
The boss says you did a great job.

26
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,959
Your year-end bonus is doubled.

27
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,199
Thank you, Boss!

28
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,519
By the way, Boss,

29
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,959
we agreed that you'd stay in the car.

30
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,280
Why did you suddenly rush out?

31
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,719
Simon,

32
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,840
say goodbye to your bonus.

33
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,439
You saw it for yourself.

34
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,840
Luo Qiansheng set up
ambushes on every single route.

35
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:04,120
Up against brute force like that,

36
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:06,919
any clever little trick
is just child's play.

37
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,439
I was too naive.

38
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:12,759
You thought of everything, Mr. Zhao.

39
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,800
I don't want your flattery.

40
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:17,360
I want you safe.

41
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,400
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

42
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:25,119
If you ever need anything
from me in the future,

43
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,000
just say the word.

44
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,000
What are you doing?

45
00:03:28,439 --> 00:03:29,439
Mr. Chen, we're here.

46
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:31,560
Thank you.

47
00:03:32,479 --> 00:03:33,479
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

48
00:03:36,132 --> 00:03:40,445
[He's stepping out
directly into traffic BTW]

49
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,360
Lucas,

50
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,639
your bonus is gone too.

51
00:03:51,913 --> 00:03:52,913
Got it, Mr. Zhao.

52
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:56,879
Luo Qiansheng,

53
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,399
you stand accused in Case 023,

54
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,878
involving major foreign trade smuggling,

55
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:01,199
colluding with corrupt officials,

56
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,960
and illegally trafficking contraband.

57
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,680
How do you plead?

58
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:08,198
Utter nonsense.

59
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:10,079
Investigate all you want.

60
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,000
Next,

61
00:04:11,001 --> 00:04:12,718
please call the third-party
compliance representative

62
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,919
and key witness to the stand.

63
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,800
State your name for the record.

64
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,600
Chen Wan.

65
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:25,319
Mr. Zhao.

66
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,959
Is it over?

67
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,480
Were you waiting here for me?

68
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:32,799
There aren't any other
hearings today, are there?

69
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,919
Just saying thank you right now

70
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:37,360
doesn't feel like nearly enough.

71
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:40,079
How about I treat you to a meal, Mr. Zhao?

72
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,560
All right.

73
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,279
Chen Wan!

74
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,679
Have you completely lost your mind?

75
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,279
You testified against him?

76
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,615
I wouldn't have even known
if someone hadn't told me!

77
00:04:52,639 --> 00:04:54,039
What possessed you to
do something so reckless?

78
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,560
Xuan,

79
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,560
calm down.

80
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,879
Do you have any idea
who's backing that bastard?

81
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,120
You think one hearing is
enough to take him down?

82
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,120
Let me tell you something.

83
00:05:03,121 --> 00:05:04,359
You're way too naive!

84
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,360
You're just a disposable pawn!

85
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,000
Once you lose your leverage,

86
00:05:06,001 --> 00:05:07,399
you're going to be a sitting duck!

87
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:09,159
Okay, stop it.

88
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,160
Calm down.

89
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:11,199
Sorry about this.

90
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,319
I couldn't stop him.

91
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,560
Everyone,

92
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:17,639
I'll explain everything to Xuan.

93
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,279
Sorry for the trouble.

94
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,160
Xuan,

95
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,519
just hear me out.

96
00:05:33,279 --> 00:05:34,279
Xuan,

97
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,760
this is just how business works.

98
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,638
Since I want that project,

99
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:39,519
I have to pay the price for it.

100
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,399
At the end of the day,

101
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,079
you still don't trust me.

102
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,199
You won't tell me anything.

103
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,560
I just wish I were actually capable,

104
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,799
instead of just having this
useless 'young master' title.

105
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,519
When it comes to your problems,

106
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,720
I can't help you at all.

107
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,560
What nonsense are you talking about?

108
00:05:57,199 --> 00:05:58,199
Yeah,

109
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,439
I'm useless.

110
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:01,840
But don't you still have Tan Youming?

111
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:04,199
And if he can't help,
there's Shen Zongnian!

112
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,519
Worst case, I'll go beg Zhao Shengge, okay?

113
00:06:07,399 --> 00:06:09,160
I'll go to his door and beg him myself!

114
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,960
Is there anything in Haishi
that Zhao Shengge can't fix?

115
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:14,199
Chen Wan,

116
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,879
you're always like this.

117
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,799
So stubborn.

118
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:19,359
You never listen to anyone,

119
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:21,399
and you refuse to accept anyone's help.

120
00:06:22,176 --> 00:06:24,096
Didn't I accept Zhao
Shengge's help this time?

121
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,560
You call that accepting help?

122
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,079
You didn't have a choice!

123
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:29,759
What if Zhao Shengge hadn't shown up?

124
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:32,199
Would you even be
standing here for me to yell at?

125
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:35,560
Is Zhao Shengge really that special?

126
00:06:36,680 --> 00:06:38,600
Why can't you ever trouble him?

127
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:41,102
Is Zhao Shengge
really that high and mighty?

128
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,519
Xuan,

129
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,879
I chose this path myself.

130
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,160
And since I chose it,

131
00:06:47,161 --> 00:06:48,295
I have to bear the consequences.

132
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:49,319
Chen Wan,

133
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,600
to be honest,

134
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:53,479
I know people like Tan
Youming and Shen Zongnian

135
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,719
aren't really friends in your book.

136
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,879
Don't bother denying it.

137
00:06:57,079 --> 00:06:57,920
You act so considerate

138
00:06:57,921 --> 00:06:59,639
and accommodating to everyone,

139
00:06:59,959 --> 00:07:00,999
and you think I can't see through it?

140
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,680
In reality, you draw a hard line
and keep everyone at arm's length.

141
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,279
Forget about them.

142
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,920
What about me?

143
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:10,120
Do you even consider me a friend at all?

144
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,519
Xuan,

145
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,720
I don't have any other friends.

146
00:07:14,319 --> 00:07:15,680
You're the only one I have.

147
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:18,359
Then why did you have
to take such a huge risk?

148
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,320
Why do you have to put
your own life on the line?

149
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:23,800
Xuan,

150
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:28,000
do you know who was in charge
of Xiaolanshan sixteen years ago?

151
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,600
Wait, you mean...

152
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,000
That's right.

153
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:40,199
This is the only thing I can do.

154
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,560
Whether it works out in the end or not,

155
00:07:42,959 --> 00:07:44,079
I have to try.

156
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,800
I can never let Luo Qiansheng off the hook.

157
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,879
Even if it's something this huge,

158
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:59,199
you shouldn't have gone in all alone!

159
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,639
Thank goodness they found out.

160
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:08,479
Unless you've walked in someone's shoes,

161
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:10,120
don't tell them to let it go.

162
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:14,000
Fine, I get it with Luo Qiansheng.

163
00:08:15,839 --> 00:08:17,119
But for future business deals,

164
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:19,319
can you stop putting yourself on the line?

165
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,959
If this deal falls through,

166
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,080
there's always the next one,

167
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,398
and the one after that!

168
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:25,480
Do you have to close
every single deal yourself?

169
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,079
Look at yourself right now.

170
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,999
You're a shadow of yourself.

171
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,239
I'm really scared that one
of these days, you'll just...

172
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,240
Xuan,

173
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,799
I am taking care of myself.

174
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,480
Taking care of yourself?

175
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,319
You call this taking care of yourself?

176
00:08:42,136 --> 00:08:44,696
Monica told me you haven't picked
up your medication in two weeks!

177
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,800
Actually, I already made
an appointment with Monica.

178
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,359
I'll definitely go this weekend.

179
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,558
I even set a reminder this time.

180
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:51,080
I promise I'll be there on time.

181
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:54,359
Why are you always worried
about troubling others?

182
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,879
What matters is your own health!

183
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,039
Do you even take it seriously?

184
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,879
I know my limits.

185
00:09:01,559 --> 00:09:02,840
Like hell you do!

186
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:04,759
Send me your new appointment time.

187
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:06,599
I'm dragging you there myself.

188
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,679
Okay.

189
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,200
Whatever you say.

190
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,200
By the way, Wan,

191
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:33,615
Tan Youming and the others
asked me to check with you.

192
00:09:33,639 --> 00:09:35,319
They're working on a
deal with Baisheng Group,

193
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,918
and he wants you there
to help smooth things over.

194
00:09:36,919 --> 00:09:37,919
Are you going?

195
00:09:38,679 --> 00:09:39,976
Though bringing this up right now...

196
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,520
I don't even know if it's appropriate.

197
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,360
Will he be there?

198
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,239
Who cares if he's going?

199
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:54,080
Go if you want to, skip it if you don't.

200
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,480
I'll go.

201
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,440
Oh, right.

202
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,360
Remember to bring two bottles of wine.

203
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,678
There's going to be a wine reception.

204
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:03,015
He Shengyuan invited a member
of the Norwegian royal family.

205
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:05,679
They'll be playing a traditional
game of theirs at the party.

206
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,999
I think it's called...

207
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,000
the Secret Exchange.

208
00:10:08,360 --> 00:10:09,878
One bottle goes into a blind draw

209
00:10:09,879 --> 00:10:11,239
for a lucky guest to pick.

210
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:14,440
The other goes in the common
area for everyone to taste.

211
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:49,919
Mr. Chen,

212
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:51,239
if none of the wines on the market

213
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,518
are to your liking,

214
00:10:52,519 --> 00:10:53,919
why not

215
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,999
try this new vintage from our winery?

216
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,120
It hasn't been released yet.

217
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,799
Sure, thank you.

218
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,519
Vibrant color,

219
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,480
medium legs,

220
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,039
and a full-bodied palate.

221
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,120
The blackcurrant notes really stand out,

222
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:21,039
and the oak finish is very well-balanced.

223
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,320
It truly is an excellent wine.

224
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,279
I'll take this one.

225
00:11:23,279 --> 00:11:23,559
Certainly.

226
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,559
Thank you.

227
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:29,120
I hope he likes it.

228
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,559
Mr. Chen,

229
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:36,600
let me take those for you.

230
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,840
Okay.

231
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:40,119
Let me give you the instructions.

232
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:41,960
This bottle of Angel's Wings

233
00:11:41,961 --> 00:11:44,080
goes into the blind draw for the exchange.

234
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:45,798
And this bottle of Eternal Earl

235
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:47,519
goes to the wine cabinet in the common area

236
00:11:47,759 --> 00:11:48,639
for everyone to enjoy.

237
00:11:48,679 --> 00:11:49,799
Understood, Mr. Chen.

238
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,360
Wan,

239
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,240
mingle on your own for a bit.

240
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:54,279
I just spotted a friend.

241
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,799
Who are you hitting on this time?

242
00:11:56,016 --> 00:11:57,735
Your pickup lines are so outdated.

243
00:11:57,759 --> 00:11:58,440
It's an actual acquaintance!

244
00:11:58,639 --> 00:11:59,759
I'll be right back.

245
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,280
Make sure you don't mix them up.

246
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:01,919
Remember,

247
00:12:02,279 --> 00:12:05,559
the one with the red ribbon
goes to the common area,

248
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:07,359
and this bottle goes
to the blind draw area.

249
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:07,960
Don't mix them up.

250
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:08,960
No problem.

251
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,080
Chen Wan.

252
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:16,279
Did you call me?

253
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,120
He's here.

254
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,120
Are you doing alright?

255
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:30,200
Mr. Zhao.

256
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,000
And this is...?

257
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,600
This is Chen Wan.

258
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,000
Hello.

259
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,839
I'm Mr. Zhao's classmate.

260
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,840
You can call me Felipe.

261
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,240
Nice to meet you, Mr. Felipe.

262
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:43,480
He's even more handsome than you, Mr. Zhao.

263
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:44,519
Thank you.

264
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,799
Felipe,

265
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:48,960
I didn't know you had an
eye for Eastern beauties.

266
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:53,919
European royalty always
loved Eastern beauty the most.

267
00:12:56,559 --> 00:12:57,976
We've been looking all over for you two!

268
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,440
So this is where you've been hiding.

269
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:01,840
Captain Zhao,

270
00:13:01,841 --> 00:13:03,439
long time no see!

271
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:03,759
Captain Zhao!

272
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:04,759
Captain Zhao!

273
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:08,039
Excuse me.

274
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,120
It's fine.

275
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,360
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

276
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,558
If there's nothing else,

277
00:13:14,559 --> 00:13:15,559
I'll excuse myself.

278
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:21,960
Shengge,

279
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,159
do you still remember me?

280
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:24,159
Yao Jianan.

281
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,479
Yao Jianan from the rowing team!

282
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,239
We represented Imperial College together

283
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:29,279
in the Rhine Spring
Regatta back in the day.

284
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:30,759
Did you forget?

285
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:31,840
That's right.

286
00:13:31,841 --> 00:13:33,158
I still remember back then,

287
00:13:33,159 --> 00:13:35,440
you were also the assistant
coach for Jianan's ski team.

288
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,839
Yeah.

289
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,000
Do you guys remember

290
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:40,319
that white guy at the ski competition

291
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,000
who looked down on us?

292
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:41,799
Yeah!

293
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,158
In the final round,

294
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:44,638
Captain Zhao led our team

295
00:13:44,639 --> 00:13:45,960
and wiped the floor with them.

296
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:47,758
When we took the trophy,

297
00:13:47,759 --> 00:13:50,799
you should've seen the
look on that guy's face!

298
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:53,079
Come to think of it, though,

299
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,558
after that competition,

300
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:55,240
Captain Zhao

301
00:13:55,241 --> 00:13:56,638
rarely hung out with us anymore.

302
00:13:56,639 --> 00:13:57,720
I've been swamped lately.

303
00:13:58,559 --> 00:13:59,559
It's been a long time.

304
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,320
Do you regret

305
00:14:02,321 --> 00:14:04,081
turning down that
admission offer back then?

306
00:14:08,799 --> 00:14:10,559
If you had accepted it,

307
00:14:11,399 --> 00:14:13,000
the one competing alongside him

308
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,440
and traveling the world

309
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,600
would've been you.

310
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,919
Just one of many.

311
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,158
Still, that beats drinking
yourself half to death

312
00:14:24,159 --> 00:14:26,600
with clients for the
sake of your company.

313
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,720
There are no 'what ifs.'

314
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,319
Honestly, the way things are now

315
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,679
is already for the best.

316
00:14:33,679 --> 00:14:34,200
Fine.

317
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,039
Mr. Zhao,

318
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:36,959
with two rounds of wine,

319
00:14:36,983 --> 00:14:39,263
tell me, which one is your favorite?

320
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:42,359
There are still many wines wines
that have not been served yet.

321
00:14:42,360 --> 00:14:44,120
I can't jump to conclusions.

322
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,679
Mr. Zhao,

323
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:47,879
you're still as scrupulous as ever.

324
00:14:48,240 --> 00:14:49,559
Yeah, I think so too.

325
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:54,080
We should try it next time.

326
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:55,679
Indeed.

327
00:14:56,912 --> 00:15:00,872
This one tastes like butterflies
dancing on the tongue.

328
00:15:03,039 --> 00:15:07,278
Chinese winemaking could
reach such wonderful highs.

329
00:15:07,302 --> 00:15:08,983
It one is pretty good. I like it.

330
00:15:09,080 --> 00:15:09,679
That's rare.

331
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:11,279
He actually said he likes it.

332
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:12,039
Whose wine is this?

333
00:15:12,039 --> 00:15:13,039
How lucky!

334
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,320
It's not mine.

335
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:17,960
Wan,

336
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:19,239
that ribbon knot...

337
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:20,240
Isn't that your wine?

338
00:15:22,799 --> 00:15:24,239
Go claim it!

339
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:24,879
There's no need.

340
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,720
All that matters is that he likes it.

341
00:15:31,559 --> 00:15:32,559
Don't go.

342
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:33,840
Jianan,

343
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,279
you picked this bottle?

344
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:37,038
Really?

345
00:15:37,039 --> 00:15:38,798
Do you know why I chose this wine?

346
00:15:38,799 --> 00:15:40,158
Back when Captain Zhao led

347
00:15:40,159 --> 00:15:40,960
our Imperial College team

348
00:15:40,961 --> 00:15:42,319
to victory, at the celebration party—.

349
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:42,919
Xuan!

350
00:15:42,919 --> 00:15:43,919
he brought a bottle of dry red

351
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,439
with blackcurrant notes.

352
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:46,960
I still remember it to this day.

353
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:48,480
Xuan,

354
00:15:48,879 --> 00:15:49,879
don't get worked up.

355
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:51,080
Let me go ask someone first.

356
00:15:53,879 --> 00:15:54,879
Excuse me,

357
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,278
may I ask

358
00:15:56,279 --> 00:15:58,239
where Mr. Chen Wan's two bottles of wine

359
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,600
were placed?

360
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,960
Let me check for you.

361
00:16:01,799 --> 00:16:02,360
Mr. Chen,

362
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,359
your Eternal Earl is
in the blind draw area,

363
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,960
and Angel's Wings is in the common area.

364
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,240
They mixed them up!

365
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,320
Keep your voice down.

366
00:16:10,039 --> 00:16:11,599
This is the staff's mistake!

367
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:12,120
No,

368
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,600
it's my mistake.

369
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,360
I shouldn't have left it to someone else.

370
00:16:16,879 --> 00:16:17,879
Why are you—

371
00:16:19,279 --> 00:16:20,320
Whatever.

372
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:21,960
Xuan,

373
00:16:22,639 --> 00:16:24,079
we're here to discuss a partnership.

374
00:16:24,080 --> 00:16:25,440
The big picture comes first.

375
00:16:25,559 --> 00:16:26,999
Screw the big picture!

376
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,000
To find this bottle,

377
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:29,639
you tasted wines from

378
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:32,000
countless wineries, big and small!

379
00:16:32,279 --> 00:16:33,960
Your stomach ulcer nearly flared up again!

380
00:16:35,639 --> 00:16:37,119
I can't let that guy take the credit!

381
00:16:39,559 --> 00:16:40,559
Let it go.

382
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:43,519
From beginning to end,

383
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:46,480
all I wanted was for
him to taste a good wine.

384
00:16:47,159 --> 00:16:49,240
Now, I've gotten my wish.

385
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,559
This is so frustrating!

386
00:16:58,480 --> 00:16:59,559
Mr. Zhao,

387
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:01,976
would you put the label on it?

388
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:04,080
I haven't tried all the wine yet.

389
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:05,640
Let's wait and see.

390
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,598
Shengge's standards are as high as ever.

391
00:17:08,599 --> 00:17:09,719
Even this isn't good enough for him.

392
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:10,999
It's okay, Jianan.

393
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:11,720
Don't be disappointed.

394
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,720
There's always next time.

395
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,079
Yeah.

396
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:17,000
I'll find another great
wine for Captain next time.

397
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,879
Next time,

398
00:17:19,902 --> 00:17:23,902
I will take you to the wine cellar
and you can steal some together.

399
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,805
OK, I'll come with you.

400
00:17:35,559 --> 00:17:36,559
Wan...

401
00:17:39,839 --> 00:17:40,839
It seems that

402
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:42,720
no matter how hard I searched,

403
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:45,680
it still wasn't enough to satisfy him.

404
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:50,839
Wan,

405
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,399
ignore him.

406
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:53,920
That's just how he is.

407
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:56,480
Nothing is ever good enough for him.

408
00:18:00,599 --> 00:18:01,279
I'm fine.

409
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,319
It's almost time.

410
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,359
Elder He will be here soon.

411
00:18:04,559 --> 00:18:05,640
We should go get ready.

412
00:18:06,799 --> 00:18:07,799
Let's go.

413
00:18:21,279 --> 00:18:23,440
Hello, Mr. Felipe.

414
00:18:23,839 --> 00:18:25,758
Are you satisfied with

415
00:18:25,759 --> 00:18:26,680
today's reception?

416
00:18:26,681 --> 00:18:27,838
Definitely.

417
00:18:27,839 --> 00:18:32,199
There's an ancient Chinese proverb,
"broadening your whore-sons."

418
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:33,119
Today,

419
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:35,838
I not only taste great Chinese wine,

420
00:18:35,839 --> 00:18:38,720
but also see Chinese beauties.

421
00:18:39,519 --> 00:18:40,960
Where is this beauty?

422
00:18:42,039 --> 00:18:42,680
Yes,

423
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,199
it's Zhao's friend.

424
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:46,038
Zhao, where he is?

425
00:18:46,039 --> 00:18:48,279
Perhaps you will see
him again next time.

426
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:51,480
I have some matters to discuss with Miss He,

427
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:52,880
so

428
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:53,960
I will leave now.

429
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:57,479
OK, well, I guess I'll drink on my own.

430
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,319
Then you can keep on talking.

431
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:09,959
Thank you handsome young
men for going to the trouble

432
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:12,000
of playing cards with an old man like me.

433
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,240
Not at all.

434
00:19:13,279 --> 00:19:14,838
You watched us grow up, Elder He.

435
00:19:14,839 --> 00:19:16,959
Playing cards with our
elders is the least we can do.

436
00:19:18,599 --> 00:19:21,400
You've even brewed my favorite tea.

437
00:19:22,079 --> 00:19:23,439
We should be thanking you, Elder He,

438
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:25,280
for hosting such a
wonderful reception for us.

439
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,720
And this is?

440
00:19:27,039 --> 00:19:28,159
I forgot to introduce him.

441
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:29,959
This is Chen Wan. He's a sharp card player.

442
00:19:29,983 --> 00:19:32,302
Even with all his money, Shen
Zongnian couldn't poach him.

443
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,000
You flatter me, Mr. Tan.

444
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:34,640
Elder He,

445
00:19:35,079 --> 00:19:36,079
it's an honor.

446
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:37,759
Ms. Xu.

447
00:19:38,079 --> 00:19:39,079
Chen Wan.

448
00:19:39,559 --> 00:19:40,759
So you're Chen Wan?

449
00:19:41,279 --> 00:19:42,440
You've heard of me, Ms. Xu?

450
00:19:42,799 --> 00:19:44,279
I hear them mention you all the time.

451
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:45,880
A pleasure to meet you.

452
00:19:46,799 --> 00:19:47,400
Alright,

453
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:48,279
enough formalities.

454
00:19:48,279 --> 00:19:49,279
Let's get started.

455
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:51,919
Take a page from Chen Wan's book.

456
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:53,400
He knows just what to say.

457
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:55,400
Yes, yes, of course.

458
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,920
Everyone,

459
00:19:57,599 --> 00:19:58,599
don't go easy on me.

460
00:20:00,559 --> 00:20:01,640
I'll be the dealer, then.

461
00:20:03,359 --> 00:20:03,799
Wan,

462
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:05,680
we're here to talk business today.

463
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:07,239
I don't know what's going on,

464
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,798
but Zhao Shengge has a total poker face,

465
00:20:08,799 --> 00:20:10,519
and Shen Zongnian is an iceberg year-round.

466
00:20:10,799 --> 00:20:12,255
You're the only one who
can play the charmer tonight,

467
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:13,279
got it?

468
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:18,039
Mr. Zhao and Elder He are on one team.

469
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:19,960
Wan and Ms. Xu are on the other.

470
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:28,920
Here we go.

471
00:20:37,599 --> 00:20:38,599
Ten.

472
00:20:40,319 --> 00:20:41,119
Shengge,

473
00:20:41,279 --> 00:20:42,960
they're coming in strong.

474
00:20:47,119 --> 00:20:48,119
Jack.

475
00:20:59,079 --> 00:21:00,079
Chen Wan,

476
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,400
it's your turn.

477
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:02,720
Pair of twos.

478
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:04,079
Pair of Kings.

479
00:21:04,319 --> 00:21:05,319
I'll take that.

480
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:08,440
Pair of sixes.

481
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,720
Chen Wan.

482
00:21:18,119 --> 00:21:19,119
Chen Wan,

483
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,400
don't you have any point cards?

484
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,160
My apologies.

485
00:21:24,799 --> 00:21:25,960
Yingying,

486
00:21:26,559 --> 00:21:28,000
that's cheating!

487
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:30,559
No table talk allowed!

488
00:21:31,839 --> 00:21:32,839
Let's continue.

489
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,240
King.

490
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:43,920
Mr. Chen,

491
00:21:44,119 --> 00:21:45,278
when I had the lead earlier,

492
00:21:45,279 --> 00:21:46,879
you could've thrown me ten points.

493
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:47,920
Instead, you played a six!

494
00:21:48,279 --> 00:21:49,518
And I had a pair of two of clubs.

495
00:21:49,519 --> 00:21:51,519
You should've played more aggressively!

496
00:21:52,079 --> 00:21:53,079
I'm sorry.

497
00:21:53,319 --> 00:21:55,200
Are you letting us win on purpose?

498
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:56,400
No,

499
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,119
I was simply outplayed.

500
00:21:58,440 --> 00:21:59,440
I admit defeat.

501
00:22:11,839 --> 00:22:12,839
Taking so long

502
00:22:13,079 --> 00:22:14,079
just to pick a card...

503
00:22:21,039 --> 00:22:22,240
Compared to last time,

504
00:22:22,599 --> 00:22:23,599
your skills have slipped.

505
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:27,960
Wan,

506
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:30,359
you're with me this round.

507
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:32,400
Shengge and Yingying can team up.

508
00:22:32,720 --> 00:22:35,278
Let's see how well they work together.

509
00:22:35,279 --> 00:22:36,599
Sure, whatever you say, Elder He.

510
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:37,599
Fine by me.

511
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,880
Great.

512
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,240
Chen Wan,

513
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:51,359
show me that boldness
you had at the hearing!

514
00:22:52,319 --> 00:22:54,199
You were at the hearing too, Mr. He?

515
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:57,519
Of course. I recognized you
the moment you walked in.

516
00:22:59,559 --> 00:23:00,559
Grandpa,

517
00:23:01,400 --> 00:23:05,240
you told me he was so calm
he seemed almost ruthless.

518
00:23:05,839 --> 00:23:08,279
He seems like a completely
different person today.

519
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:10,160
He's much more like
what Felipe called him—

520
00:23:10,599 --> 00:23:11,839
an Eastern beauty.

521
00:23:13,119 --> 00:23:14,119
Young man,

522
00:23:15,200 --> 00:23:16,720
aren't you afraid of Luo Qiansheng?

523
00:23:17,279 --> 00:23:18,279
I've already crossed him.

524
00:23:18,559 --> 00:23:19,679
Being afraid won't help now.

525
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:21,136
You don't need to be afraid of him.

526
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:22,960
You have so many friends
here backing you up.

527
00:23:23,559 --> 00:23:25,279
Thank you for looking out for me, Elder He.

528
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:28,440
With the way Shengge is playing,

529
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,960
it looks like he's showing
He Shengyuan no mercy.

530
00:23:32,960 --> 00:23:34,479
We're supposed to be
here to discuss a partnership.

531
00:23:34,480 --> 00:23:35,679
I have no idea what's
gotten into Zhao Shengge,

532
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,680
keeping that stone-cold
poker face the whole time.

533
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,200
Game over.

534
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,599
I'm sorry,

535
00:23:42,799 --> 00:23:43,480
we lost again.

536
00:23:43,640 --> 00:23:45,598
It's not your fault.

537
00:23:45,599 --> 00:23:48,880
Shengge is just too good
at feeding cards to Zhiying.

538
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,798
Even so, I still refused to
wear the ring he gave me.

539
00:23:50,799 --> 00:23:52,119
Could it be...

540
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,519
an engagement ring?

541
00:23:53,960 --> 00:23:55,239
With that one comment from Elder He,

542
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:57,240
the whole city is going to be talking.

543
00:24:08,559 --> 00:24:09,240
Have a drink

544
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:10,400
and relax a little.

545
00:24:15,279 --> 00:24:15,880
I'll pass.

546
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:16,880
I just took my medicine.

547
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:20,960
Wan,

548
00:24:21,640 --> 00:24:22,920
Shengge isn't usually like this.

549
00:24:24,240 --> 00:24:26,000
I don't know what's
gotten into him tonight.

550
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:30,480
What's on your mind?

551
00:24:34,480 --> 00:24:36,159
It's okay, you don't have to force a smile.

552
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,160
I'm really fine.

553
00:24:42,240 --> 00:24:43,240
You have to trust him.

554
00:24:46,799 --> 00:24:47,799
He is free,

555
00:24:49,119 --> 00:24:50,279
and so am I.

556
00:24:52,000 --> 00:24:54,119
I'm not sure how to explain it to you,

557
00:24:55,440 --> 00:24:56,440
but the way I see it,

558
00:24:56,839 --> 00:24:57,839
Xuan,

559
00:24:58,920 --> 00:25:00,240
you don't need to worry about me.

560
00:25:02,039 --> 00:25:03,599
Yes, I have an unrequited crush on him,

561
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:06,159
but when it comes to feelings,

562
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:07,480
the two of us are equals.

563
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:10,640
Zhao Shengge has his freedom,

564
00:25:11,920 --> 00:25:14,279
and I have the freedom to stop dreaming.

565
00:25:16,799 --> 00:25:18,279
This is my game,

566
00:25:19,319 --> 00:25:20,319
and the initiative

567
00:25:20,599 --> 00:25:21,640
is in my hands.

568
00:25:34,039 --> 00:25:35,039
I'm really fine.

569
00:25:35,559 --> 00:25:37,119
If you have things to do, go ahead.

570
00:25:40,039 --> 00:25:41,039
Are you sure you're okay?

571
00:25:43,680 --> 00:25:44,680
I'm really okay.

572
00:25:45,359 --> 00:25:46,359
I'll head out first.

573
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:55,000
Mr. Zhao,

574
00:25:55,160 --> 00:25:56,600
here is the wine I decanted for you.

575
00:25:56,759 --> 00:25:57,400
Take it away.

576
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,000
Yes, sir.

577
00:25:58,559 --> 00:25:59,559
Wait.

578
00:26:00,720 --> 00:26:01,160
Bring it here.

579
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:02,720
Just leave it with me.

580
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:39,879
We heard Baisheng will be involved in Minglong's
new pier development project. Is that true?

581
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:40,799
Yes.

582
00:26:40,800 --> 00:26:43,240
Zhao Shengge of Minglong
has shown great sincerity.

583
00:26:43,319 --> 00:26:45,239
And there's going to be a wedding
of the century in Haishi soon!

584
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:46,558
Is it between Mr. Zhao and Ms. Xu?

585
00:26:46,559 --> 00:26:48,118
Aren't you a financial reporter?

586
00:26:48,119 --> 00:26:49,680
Why are you so nosy?

587
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:53,640
Move out.

588
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,680
Just my luck.

589
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:13,720
Chen Wan!

590
00:28:13,759 --> 00:28:14,759
It's you!

591
00:28:23,799 --> 00:28:25,079
Are you guys crazy?!

592
00:28:42,400 --> 00:28:43,400
Get out of here!

593
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,599
Watch out!

594
00:29:08,119 --> 00:29:09,439
Playing chicken with our lives?

595
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:10,440
Fine!

596
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,160
Let's see who's harder to kill!

597
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:31,160
Miss Xu.

598
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:31,680
Chen Wan!

599
00:30:31,759 --> 00:30:32,759
Are you alright?

600
00:30:33,079 --> 00:30:34,200
I'm fine, Miss Xu.

601
00:30:36,039 --> 00:30:37,039
You're hurt.

602
00:30:37,559 --> 00:30:38,775
I'm taking you to the hospital.

603
00:30:38,799 --> 00:30:39,799
Really, there's no need.

604
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,240
I'm okay.

605
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:43,120
I don't want to trouble you, Miss Xu.

606
00:30:43,319 --> 00:30:44,999
But you're badly injured right now.

607
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,000
Miss Xu,

608
00:30:46,279 --> 00:30:47,200
I can handle this myself.

609
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:48,039
Don't worry.

610
00:30:48,039 --> 00:30:48,640
Miss,

611
00:30:48,640 --> 00:30:49,519
you're their target.

612
00:30:49,519 --> 00:30:50,440
It's too dangerous here.

613
00:30:50,441 --> 00:30:51,681
We need to get out of here now.

614
00:30:53,319 --> 00:30:54,279
Words aren't enough to thank you.

615
00:30:54,280 --> 00:30:55,480
I owe you a huge favor.

616
00:30:56,079 --> 00:30:57,358
If you ever need
anything, just say the word,

617
00:30:57,359 --> 00:30:57,960
okay?

618
00:30:58,079 --> 00:30:58,480
Understood,

619
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,480
Miss Xu.

620
00:31:02,079 --> 00:31:03,079
Let's go.

621
00:31:12,039 --> 00:31:13,479
Why are you wearing the family ring?

622
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:16,400
The old man made me wear it.

623
00:31:17,559 --> 00:31:20,399
Wouldn't look good sending someone
to the hospital on a day like today.

624
00:31:21,519 --> 00:31:22,519
How dutiful of you.

625
00:31:24,799 --> 00:31:26,999
Old Mr. He came out to
endorse you in person this time.

626
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,800
Looks like he has a lot of faith in you.

627
00:31:34,279 --> 00:31:35,279
What's your move?

628
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,480
What about you?

629
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:40,160
After all these years,

630
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,200
have you really just let it go?

631
00:31:50,839 --> 00:31:51,839
It is what it is.

632
00:31:52,480 --> 00:31:53,720
Keeping things happy like this,

633
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,400
it's good enough for me.

634
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:59,000
You're not planning to tell him?

635
00:32:01,799 --> 00:32:03,039
It's not that I won't. I can't.

636
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:14,160
Zhao Shengge,

637
00:32:14,440 --> 00:32:15,735
I need the surveillance
footage from the intersection.

638
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:16,759
I was ambushed.

639
00:32:17,359 --> 00:32:18,559
Thankfully, Chen Wan saved me.

640
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:19,799
He's hurt.

641
00:32:19,800 --> 00:32:21,495
He refused to let me
take him to the hospital,

642
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:23,239
and he's still at the crash site right now.

643
00:32:24,039 --> 00:32:24,559
I'm leaving.

644
00:32:24,799 --> 00:32:25,815
Go pull the surveillance footage.

645
00:32:25,839 --> 00:32:26,559
Zhixuan, with me.

646
00:32:26,560 --> 00:32:27,775
Something happened to Chen Wan.

647
00:32:27,799 --> 00:32:28,799
What's going on?

648
00:32:31,359 --> 00:32:32,838
Mr. Zhao is in such a rush.

649
00:32:32,839 --> 00:32:34,279
Why did he just storm out like that?

650
00:32:39,039 --> 00:32:39,440
Hello?

651
00:32:39,680 --> 00:32:40,240
Found it.

652
00:32:40,240 --> 00:32:41,160
At the fourth intersection.

653
00:32:41,161 --> 00:32:43,079
The security team just
sent over all the files.

654
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:44,680
Got it.

655
00:32:48,759 --> 00:32:49,319
Um,

656
00:32:49,480 --> 00:32:50,936
it's the remnants of White Crane Hall.

657
00:32:50,960 --> 00:32:52,078
As for the exact details,

658
00:32:52,079 --> 00:32:53,839
we'll have to ask Chen
Wan to know for sure.

659
00:32:56,073 --> 00:32:57,073
Well then...

660
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:58,360
We'll talk when we get there.

661
00:34:03,839 --> 00:34:05,480
Mount Fuji is too far away.

662
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:07,240
I won't get to see it.

663
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:56,239
Chen Wan!

664
00:34:58,599 --> 00:34:59,599
Chen Wan!

665
00:35:07,199 --> 00:35:08,199
Chen Wan!

666
00:35:09,039 --> 00:35:10,039
Chen Wan!
